{"id":"a4bdf08ca36b4b17","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-hereditary-base-expression.md","title":"遗传底数表达式的有限树","display":"df-hereditary-base-expression — 遗传底数表达式的有限树","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-hereditary-base-expression","aliases":["72-df-hereditary-base-expression"],"display":"df-hereditary-base-expression — 遗传底数表达式的有限树","depends_on":[],"chapter":"III","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III Definition5.1, print191/PDF203; explicit finite syntax","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"base expansion uniqueness and recursion measure checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion","review_2026_10_22_expansion":"明确本节点有序对投影采用从0起的指标约定"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-hereditary-base-expression"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-hereditary-base-expression</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hereditary-base-expression — 遗传底数表达式的有限树"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"III"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III Definition5.1, print191/PDF203; explicit finite syntax"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"base expansion uniqueness and recursion measure checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_expansion","html":"明确本节点有序对投影采用从0起的指标约定"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\omega\">\\(b\\in\\omega\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\ge2\">\\(b\\ge2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m,k\\in\\omega\">\\(n,m,k\\in\\omega\\)</span>。有限序列按自然数初段编号，空和为0。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_h\">\\(\\mathcal E_h\\)</span> 的节点为有限个“子表达式、正系数”对组成的序列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dig}_b\">\\(\\operatorname{Dig}_b\\)</span> 为下式唯一性式指定的普通底数展开。</li>\n<li>本节点的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_0\">\\(\\pi_0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1\">\\(\\pi_1\\)</span> 依次表示有序对的第一、第二投影。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nE_0&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\},\\quad\nE_{m+1}:=E_m\\cup\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}(E_m\\times(\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}))^k,\\quad\n\\mathcal E_h:=\\bigcup_{m\\in\\omega}E_m,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Dig}_b(n)&amp;:=\\iota d\\in(\\omega\\times\\omega)^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\bigl[\n\\forall j&lt;|d|\\ (1\\le\\pi_1(d_j)&lt;b)\\land\n\\forall j\\in\\omega\\ (j+1&lt;|d|\\Rightarrow\\pi_0(d_{j+1})&lt;\\pi_0(d_j))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\land n=\\sum_{j&lt;|d|}b^{\\pi_0(d_j)}\\pi_1(d_j)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Her}_b(0)&amp;:=\\langle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Her}_b(n)&amp;:=\\left\\langle\n\\left\\langle\\operatorname{Her}_b(\\pi_0(\\operatorname{Dig}_b(n)_j)),\\pi_1(\\operatorname{Dig}_b(n)_j)\\right\\rangle\n\\right\\rangle_{j&lt;|\\operatorname{Dig}_b(n)|}\\quad(0&lt;n).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nE_0&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\},\\quad\nE_{m+1}:=E_m\\cup\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}(E_m\\times(\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}))^k,\\quad\n\\mathcal E_h:=\\bigcup_{m\\in\\omega}E_m,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Dig}_b(n)&amp;:=\\iota d\\in(\\omega\\times\\omega)^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\bigl[\n\\forall j&lt;|d|\\ (1\\le\\pi_1(d_j)&lt;b)\\land\n\\forall j\\in\\omega\\ (j+1&lt;|d|\\Rightarrow\\pi_0(d_{j+1})&lt;\\pi_0(d_j))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\land n=\\sum_{j&lt;|d|}b^{\\pi_0(d_j)}\\pi_1(d_j)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Her}_b(0)&amp;:=\\langle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Her}_b(n)&amp;:=\\left\\langle\n\\left\\langle\\operatorname{Her}_b(\\pi_0(\\operatorname{Dig}_b(n)_j)),\\pi_1(\\operatorname{Dig}_b(n)_j)\\right\\rangle\n\\right\\rangle_{j&lt;|\\operatorname{Dig}_b(n)|}\\quad(0&lt;n).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>π₀、π₁ 是元语言有序对的两投影，系数是正整数且严格小于 b。反复除以 b 给普通展开的存在唯一性；n&gt;0 的每个指数都小于 n，所以 Her 的课程值递归良基。按指数递归书写正是原书 complete base form。空展开只表示0；不能在树中保留任意零系数造成非唯一表示。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"b\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"b\\ge2","display":false},{"tex":"n,m,k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_h","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Dig}_b","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nE_0&:=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\},\\quad\nE_{m+1}:=E_m\\cup\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}(E_m\\times(\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}))^k,\\quad\n\\mathcal E_h:=\\bigcup_{m\\in\\omega}E_m,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Dig}_b(n)&:=\\iota d\\in(\\omega\\times\\omega)^{<\\omega}\\ \\bigl[\n\\forall j<|d|\\ (1\\le\\pi_1(d_j)<b)\\land\n\\forall j\\in\\omega\\ (j+1<|d|\\Rightarrow\\pi_0(d_{j+1})<\\pi_0(d_j))\\\\\n&\\hspace{35mm}\\land n=\\sum_{j<|d|}b^{\\pi_0(d_j)}\\pi_1(d_j)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Her}_b(0)&:=\\langle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Her}_b(n)&:=\\left\\langle\n\\left\\langle\\operatorname{Her}_b(\\pi_0(\\operatorname{Dig}_b(n)_j)),\\pi_1(\\operatorname{Dig}_b(n)_j)\\right\\rangle\n\\right\\rangle_{j<|\\operatorname{Dig}_b(n)|}\\quad(0<n).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2298,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-130","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]] · [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]] · [[72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence]] · [[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]] · [[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]] · [[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"},{"id":"23689fb4bbf5ac96","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E_h$ 与 $\\operatorname{Her}_b$ 取 [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]]；$E=\\langle\\langle E_j,d_j\\rangle\\rangle_{j<k}\\in\\mathcal E_h$。$c\\in\\omega$，c≥2；$\\varepsilon_0$ 取 [[72-df-epsilon-0]]。"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-127","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]] · [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]] · [[72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence]] · [[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]] · [[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]] · [[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-500","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]] · [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]] · [[72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence]] · [[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]] · [[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]] · [[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"}],"outgoing":[]}